      "text": "9 days in Rio de Janeiro, Foz do Iguaçu and São Paulo with English-speaking guides. Visit Sugarloaf, Corcovado and Santa Teresa, the Tijuca rainforest, the Brazilian side of Iguazu Falls with Macuco Safari, and the Japanese district of Liberdade. The programme is designed for a group of 40+1 and includes the meals and themed dinners listed in the services.",
